    "detailed_description": "<strong>Them or Us</strong> is a hardcore open-world, first person tactical survival shooter game set in a post-apocalyptic world. The events of Them or Us take place on a fictional chain of islands in the Bering Sea where Soviet and Western civilizations collide!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A 256Km2 map with a variety of beautiful landscapes featuring multiple land masses and swimmable underwater biomes (Demo will feature a 16KM^2 island).<br></li><li>Up to 100 players fighting to survive by all means necessary. Kill on sight, make friends, or kidnap strangers and feed them to the horde... Anything goes!<br></li><li>A variety of environmental threats that will test your capabilities. From erratic weather and dangerous wildlife to pitch-black nights and flesh-eating infected. Not to mention other survivors (players) &amp; bandits (AI)!<br></li><li>Discover hidden facilities and stocks, sealed offices and underground warehouses to find useful information and items which will help to understand what is happening on the Island(s). <br></li><li>Compete with players (online) to wipe out AI bandits &amp; military personnel in dynamic pop-up events and recover supply drops &amp; earn rare rewards.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964020/extras/c93b4ab5de05d605035163c02ad8c3ec.avif?t=1670801397\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Feel your character via health and complex medical / physical characteristics, including hydration, energy, blood-loss, fractures, contusion, intoxication, exhaustion, tremors, sickness, radiation and much more. <br></li><li>Control your character completely - smooth speed and stance changes and transitions, prone and leaning with the ability to fine tune everything to get the perfect fighting position and utilize the environment around you.<br></li><li>Be aware of real-life ballistics and projectile hit physics including penetration.<br></li><li>Prepare to feel your weapon as it is in real life. Familiarize yourself with the basic concepts of weapon operating - jamming, overheating, wear-out, reloading, aiming, charging and, of course, shooting.<br></li><li>Discover the most advanced weapon modding system ever. Change EVERYTHING you want to expand your weapon\u2019s tactical abilities and create your ideal kit for survival.<br></li><li>Interact with the environment to gain situational advantages- switch lights, breach doors, create distractions &amp; dominate the enemy.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964020/extras/95adb29019aec2a13c4165f481ff92dd.avif?t=1670801397\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>When you die, you leave everything behind with your corpse and start a new life.<br></li><li>Authentic survival mechanics, including hunting, crafting, building, health preservation, and resource management.<br></li><li>Unpredictable interactions with other players leading to limitless gameplay.<br></li><li>Utilize special equipment like NVGs, radio headsets, GPS tracking systems, ballistic vests and helmets &amp; more.<br></li><li>The louder your scream - the faster they come. Get your trigger finger ready for the incoming horde.<br></li><li>Confront AI driven civilian bandits in random dynamic events for a shot at rare equipment and supplies.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964020/extras/50d6ad8581e1c29792184de6eeae86ab.avif?t=1670801397\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a large amount of non-combat activities including crafting, base building, horticulture, resource harvesting, &amp; more!<br></li><li>Communicate and trade with NPC merchants, gain their trust to get special goods and quests.<br></li><li>Sell your loot to vendors or other players in barter fairs and auctions.<br></li><li>Build up your stash, heal your character, repair and modify weapons and vehicles, examine items, &amp; more!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Them or Us</strong> is a hardcore open-world, first person tactical survival shooter game set in a post-apocalyptic world. The events of Them or Us take place on a fictional chain of islands in the Bering Sea where Soviet and Western civilizations collide!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A 256Km2 map with a variety of beautiful landscapes featuring multiple land masses and swimmable underwater biomes (Demo will feature a 16KM^2 island).<br></li><li>Up to 100 players fighting to survive by all means necessary. Kill on sight, make friends, or kidnap strangers and feed them to the horde... Anything goes!<br></li><li>A variety of environmental threats that will test your capabilities. From erratic weather and dangerous wildlife to pitch-black nights and flesh-eating infected. Not to mention other survivors (players) &amp; bandits (AI)!<br></li><li>Discover hidden facilities and stocks, sealed offices and underground warehouses to find useful information and items which will help to understand what is happening on the Island(s). <br></li><li>Compete with players (online) to wipe out AI bandits &amp; military personnel in dynamic pop-up events and recover supply drops &amp; earn rare rewards.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964020/extras/c93b4ab5de05d605035163c02ad8c3ec.avif?t=1670801397\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Feel your character via health and complex medical / physical characteristics, including hydration, energy, blood-loss, fractures, contusion, intoxication, exhaustion, tremors, sickness, radiation and much more. <br></li><li>Control your character completely - smooth speed and stance changes and transitions, prone and leaning with the ability to fine tune everything to get the perfect fighting position and utilize the environment around you.<br></li><li>Be aware of real-life ballistics and projectile hit physics including penetration.<br></li><li>Prepare to feel your weapon as it is in real life. Familiarize yourself with the basic concepts of weapon operating - jamming, overheating, wear-out, reloading, aiming, charging and, of course, shooting.<br></li><li>Discover the most advanced weapon modding system ever. Change EVERYTHING you want to expand your weapon\u2019s tactical abilities and create your ideal kit for survival.<br></li><li>Interact with the environment to gain situational advantages- switch lights, breach doors, create distractions &amp; dominate the enemy.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964020/extras/95adb29019aec2a13c4165f481ff92dd.avif?t=1670801397\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>When you die, you leave everything behind with your corpse and start a new life.<br></li><li>Authentic survival mechanics, including hunting, crafting, building, health preservation, and resource management.<br></li><li>Unpredictable interactions with other players leading to limitless gameplay.<br></li><li>Utilize special equipment like NVGs, radio headsets, GPS tracking systems, ballistic vests and helmets &amp; more.<br></li><li>The louder your scream - the faster they come. Get your trigger finger ready for the incoming horde.<br></li><li>Confront AI driven civilian bandits in random dynamic events for a shot at rare equipment and supplies.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964020/extras/50d6ad8581e1c29792184de6eeae86ab.avif?t=1670801397\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a large amount of non-combat activities including crafting, base building, horticulture, resource harvesting, &amp; more!<br></li><li>Communicate and trade with NPC merchants, gain their trust to get special goods and quests.<br></li><li>Sell your loot to vendors or other players in barter fairs and auctions.<br></li><li>Build up your stash, heal your character, repair and modify weapons and vehicles, examine items, &amp; more!</li></ul>",
