        "notes": "The game contains strong themes of a zombie apocalypse including gun violence, trauma, gore and dismemberment (for both the dead and living) and hardships built into the survival gameplay. The theme of the game is open-world zombie horror survival and contains many stylistic cues and concepts that may not be suitable for young children. Text Logs, Audio logs/recordings that contain world building elements that depict the fall of society and chaotic/tragic themes. The game features voice actors depicting dark situations such as Death, Triage, Turning into zombies, Illegal medical experiments & drug use among other theme appropriate concepts. Online gameplay may vary!"
    },
